  "text": "proprium.dominica-ix-post-pentecosten-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “9th Sunday after Pentecost” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "May the partaking of Your sacrament, we beseech You, O Lord, cleanse us and unite us. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen."
    }
  },
